; Show a location: its text, picture, obstacles, exits and objects
;
; The second half of #R$9630 (which has put the "<subject> are in" intro message
; in HL). Prints the intro, then the location's description message or its name
; (#R$9686), draws the picture (#R$7F78) and, when one was drawn, waits for a key
; (#R$969A; the border goes white). Then a new line, the doors and other
; obstacles (#R$A0C8), the visible exits (#R$A138) and "You see :" with the
; objects lying here (#R$9F94).
; .
; Hardware: the picture drawing and the key wait (see #R$7F78, #R$969A).
;
; A Location id
; HL Intro message
@label=ShowLocation
c$965B LD B,A               ; B = location
 $965C CALL $9BB1           ; IX = its record
 $965F CALL $72DD           ; "<subject> are in"
 $9662 LD L,(IX+$08)        ; HL = description message (+8) ...
 $9665 LD H,(IX+$09)
 $9668 LD A,H               ; ... Z when it has none
 $9669 OR L
 $966A CALL $9686           ; description or name
 $966D LD A,B
 $966E CALL $7F78           ; the picture
 $9671 LD A,($7F77)         ; PictureFound
 $9674 INC A                ; $FF: no picture drawn
 $9675 CALL NZ,$969A        ; keep the picture until a key is pressed
 $9678 CALL $8583           ; new line
 $967B LD A,B               ; doors, rivers, webs on the exits
 $967C CALL $A0C8
; Entry point of #R$96A8: the lists without the picture.
@label=ShowLocation_Lists
*$967F LD A,B               ; B = location
 $9680 CALL $A138           ; visible exits
 $9683 JP $9F94             ; "You see :" and the objects here
